# Files excluded from the CODE SNAPSHOT that every component uploads.
#
# Each component declares `code: ../..` (the repo root) so `src/` is importable
# in the job. Without this file that snapshot is ~199 MB, re-uploaded per
# component per submit. With it, ~1 MB.
#
# Syntax is .gitignore's, but this is a SEPARATE file on purpose: .gitignore
# controls what gets committed, .amlignore controls what gets shipped to compute.
# Data belongs in Data Assets (mounted at runtime), never in the snapshot.

# Unrelated project vendored into this repo (188 MB)
windturbine-mlops/

# Data — lives in Blob as the `energy_raw` Data Asset and is mounted, not shipped
data/
feature_store/feature_repo/data/

# Python noise
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.ruff_cache/
.pytest_cache/
.venv/
venv/

# Local run artifacts
mlruns/
mlartifacts/
outputs/
.coverage

# Docs / IaC are not needed on the compute node
docs/
infra/

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
